# Citation metadata for GOPAL.
#
# GitHub reads this file and offers a "Cite this repository" button, and Zenodo
# reads it when minting a DOI for a release. The audience for this library
# writes papers, policy submissions and regulator guidance, so being citable in
# a form they can paste is worth more than another badge.
#
# The version and release date are checked against VERSION in CI by
# scripts/check-version-refs.sh, because every other hand-maintained number in
# this repository has drifted at least once.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GOPAL in your research or compliance work, please cite it as below."
title: "GOPAL: the Rego policy library for AI compliance"
abstract: >-
  GOPAL encodes AI-governance requirements as executable Open Policy Agent
  policies written in Rego, covering the EU AI Act, the UK AI framework,
  NIST AI RMF, aviation safety standards, financial services, education,
  healthcare and legal practice. Each policy cites the provision it enforces
  and ships with tests, and per-article coverage matrices state what is
  implemented and what is not, so the library can be audited rather than
  trusted. 91 policies reach a verdict; evaluation runs in any OPA
  installation with no service dependency.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Madan
    given-names: Kapil
    affiliation: "Principled Evolution"
  - name: "Principled Evolution"
    website: "https://principledevolution.ai"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-29"
license: Apache-2.0
# The concept DOI, which always resolves to the most recent release. Cite this
# one unless you specifically need to pin a reader to a particular release, in
# which case use the version DOI listed under identifiers. Zenodo mints the
# version DOI when the release is published, so it is added here afterwards.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22142302
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22142302
    description: Concept DOI, resolving to the latest release.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22161094
    description: DOI for version 2.0.0.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22142303
    description: DOI for version 1.3.1.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Principled-Evolution/gopal"
url: "https://github.com/Principled-Evolution/gopal"
keywords:
  - ai-governance
  - ai-compliance
  - eu-ai-act
  - nist-ai-rmf
  - policy-as-code
  - open-policy-agent
  - opa
  - rego
  - regulatory-compliance
  - responsible-ai
